description:
Enable Row-Level Security on all domain tables.

Migration steps:
1. ALTER TABLE {tickets,contacts,accounts,leads,ticket_comments,ticket_attachments} ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
2. ALTER TABLE ... FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
3. CREATE POLICY tenant ON ... USING (org_id = current_setting('app.current_org_id', true)::uuid);

Middleware: extend existing org-scope middleware to call SET LOCAL app.current_org_id = $1 via pgx connection before each query.

Integration test: create 2 orgs with separate data, confirm GET /tickets only returns own-org tickets under both ORG_MODE=single and ORG_MODE=multi.

Note: In single mode, SET LOCAL still runs (to the seeded org_id) — RLS stays enabled but is trivially satisfied.

