- api/cmd/server/main.go, api/internal/{auth,helpdesk,crm,db,middleware,config}
- web/src/{api,components/ui,features/{helpdesk,crm},stores,router.tsx}
- infra/docker/{Dockerfile.api,Dockerfile.web,nginx.conf}
- Move existing Go code into api/, frontend into web/
- Carry over working migrations, handlers, models
- Update all import paths
- Update CI workflows for new paths
- Update docker-compose files

